nLoad path: `journal.extend` default false, no repair. But if ledger has both null and valid same source, entries retain both; report still crash until reimport. Fine. No silent drop.\n\nRenamed recovery semantic matching. Good.\nPotential source exact vs semantic. Exact match uses source; if candidate description changed, repairs. Great.\n\nNeed adjust test source.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1e949ee8d001QmPIMBIF51IVM0","sessionID":"ses_e16be6397ffeTX69h5hAKoGVW8","messageID":"msg_1e949e3b2001Jj70qT3KGHShXf"}}
